  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Judicial Efficiency Project - Monitoring</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">R&#xe4;ttsv&#xe4;sendets effektivitet</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektet syftar till att f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra effektiviteten i domstolarna i    allm&#xe4;nhet. I synnerhet kommer det dock att rikta ineffektivitet i     behandlingen av tvistem&#xe5;l i landets domstolar i f&#xf6;rsta instans.       Projektet kommer att genomf&#xf6;ras av den h&#xf6;ga domar-och &#xe5;klagarr&#xe5;det    (HJPC).</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims at improving the efficiency of courts in general. In particular however, it will target inefficiency in the processing of  civil cases in the country&apos;s first instance courts. The Project will  be implemented by the High Judicial and Prosecutorial Council (HJPC).</narrative>
  </description>
